{"segs": ["PA_ja_31:0.1"], "en": "Jātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_31:0.2", "PA_ja_31:0.3"], "en": "The First Book, The Section on Bird’s Nests (Kulāvakavagga)", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_31:0.4"], "en": "1. The Kulāvakajātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_31:1.1"], "en": "“O Mātali, there are bird-nests in the śimśapā tree;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_31:1.2"], "en": "avoid them with the front of your chariot.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_31:1.3"], "en": "\"Even if we must give up our lives among the Asuras,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_31:1.4"], "en": "let us not become owls that live in nests.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_31:2.1"], "en": "Thus ends the first Jātaka, the Kulāvakajātakam.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"}
]
